      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "To add to this, Tabletop Simulator has a very similar system.\nIt **can** get annoying if you get spammed with the messages, but that far outweighs the disadvantage of... not having that feature in the first place 😅\nOne thing I would add: \"Trust this domain\". That'll greatly reduce the amount of confirmations needed for common websites, like YouTube, Discord or third-party sites you might want to visit frequently.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
